{"seq":3,"slug":"split-idempotent","title":"分账幂等与退款冲分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/transaction-split/split-idempotent","wordCount":1951,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"分账幂等与退款冲分\">分账幂等与退款冲分</h1><p>支付回调是<strong>至少一次投递</strong>的，这是所有分账系统的前提假设而不是异常情况。同一笔订单的分账指令可能到达两次、三次，可能乱序，可能在退款之后才到。本文讲三件事：分账指令如何保证幂等、乱序与迟到指令如何收敛、退款如何在只追加账本上做反向冲分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-幂等键是业务主键-不是请求-id\">核心概念：幂等键是业务主键，不是请求 ID</h2><p>幂等设计的第一决定是<strong>用什么做幂等键</strong>。几乎所有新手都先用请求 ID，然后发现它无效——因为重投时调用方会生成新的请求 ID。</p>\n<p>正确的幂等键必须满足两条：<strong>由业务事实唯一决定</strong>，且<strong>在重投时保持不变</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务动作</th>\n<th>幂等键</th>\n<th>为什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单分账</td>\n<td><code>orderId</code></td>\n<td>一笔订单只分账一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道支付回调</td>\n<td>渠道流水号 <code>channelTxnId</code></td>\n<td>同一笔渠道交易只有一个号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款分账</td>\n<td><code>refundId</code></td>\n<td>一次退款一次冲分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提现打款</td>\n<td><code>withdrawalId</code></td>\n<td>一次申请一次打款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>释放（在途转可提现）</td>\n<td><code>(orderId, &#39;RELEASE&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>一笔订单只释放一次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>复合键用于<strong>同一业务对象上的多次不同动作</strong>：一笔订单既要分账又要释放，如果都只用 <code>orderId</code>，第二次会被误判为重复。加动作类型后缀是最简单的解法。</p>\n<p>实现上，<strong>唯一约束是唯一可靠的仲裁者</strong>。先查后写在并发下必然失效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function runSplit(cmd: SplitCommand): Promise&lt;SplitResult&gt; {&#10;  const idemKey = `SPLIT:${cmd.orderId}`;&#10;  try {&#10;    await db.txGroups.insert(&#10;      { txGroupId: ulid(), idemKey, orderId: cmd.orderId, status: &#39;PENDING&#39;, at: now() },&#10;      { unique: [&#39;idemKey&#39;] },&#10;    );&#10;  } catch (e) {&#10;    if (isUniqueViolation(e)) {&#10;      const existing = await db.txGroups.findByIdemKey(idemKey);&#10;      if (existing.status === &#39;DONE&#39;) return toResult(existing);&#10;      if (existing.status === &#39;PENDING&#39;) throw new InFlightError(idemKey);&#10;      throw new Error(`unexpected status ${existing.status}`);&#10;    }&#10;    throw e;&#10;  }&#10;  const entries = buildEntries(cmd);&#10;  assertBalanced(entries);&#10;  await db.entries.insertMany(entries);&#10;  await db.txGroups.update({ idemKey }, { status: &#39;DONE&#39;, entryCount: entries.length });&#10;  return toResult(entries);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runSplit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SplitCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SplitResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idemKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `SPLIT:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cmd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.txGroups.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { txGroupId: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ulid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), idemKey, orderId: cmd.orderId, status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, at: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { unique: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'idemKey'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isUniqueViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.txGroups.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByIdemKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(idemKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (existing.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(existing);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (existing.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InFlightError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(idemKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`unexpected status ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">existing</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  assertBalanced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entries);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.entries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insertMany</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entries);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.txGroups.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ idemKey }, { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entryCount: entries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entries);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个细节决定了这段代码在真实并发下是否成立。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，<code>idemKey</code> 的插入必须先于所有业务写入</strong>，作为「抢占」动作。这样并发请求中只有一个能插入成功，其余的在唯一冲突分支里等待或报错。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，<code>PENDING</code> 状态必须被显式处理。</strong> 如果第一个请求插入了 <code>PENDING</code> 然后进程崩溃，唯一约束会永远挡住后续重试。解法是让 <code>PENDING</code> 带一个租约时间：超过租约的重试请求用 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code> 接管并把状态推进到 <code>DONE</code>，或者走一条补偿路径。<strong>没有 <code>PENDING</code> 超时机制的幂等实现，会在第一次进程崩溃时把订单永久卡住。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>其三，<code>assertBalanced</code> 必须在写入之前</strong>。如果分录不平衡，应该在占用幂等键之后立刻失败并释放（删除该 <code>PENDING</code> 记录或标记 <code>FAILED</code>），否则这笔订单会被一条错误指令永久锁死。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乱序与迟到-状态机而非条件判断\">乱序与迟到：状态机而非条件判断</h2><p>分账之后还有一系列后续动作，它们到达的顺序不可控：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>SPLIT</code>（分账）</li>\n<li><code>RELEASE</code>（在途转可提现）</li>\n<li><code>REFUND</code>（退款冲分）</li>\n<li><code>CHARGEBACK</code>（拒付）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果系统用「先做 A 再做 B」的调用链，任何乱序都会出错：<code>REFUND</code> 比 <code>SPLIT</code> 先到，退款时找不到可冲的分录，只能报错等待重试。</p>\n<p><strong>正确做法是把每个业务对象的资金状态建模为一台状态机，每个事件都是一次状态迁移尝试，不合法则暂存（park）。</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type FundState = &#39;NONE&#39; | &#39;SPLIT_DONE&#39; | &#39;RELEASED&#39; | &#39;PARTIALLY_REFUNDED&#39; | &#39;REFUNDED&#39;;&#10;&#10;const transitions: Record&lt;FundState, Record&lt;string, FundState&gt;&gt; = {&#10;  NONE: { SPLIT: &#39;SPLIT_DONE&#39; },&#10;  SPLIT_DONE: { RELEASE: &#39;RELEASED&#39;, REFUND: &#39;PARTIALLY_REFUNDED&#39; },&#10;  RELEASED: { REFUND: &#39;PARTIALLY_REFUNDED&#39; },&#10;  PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: { REFUND: &#39;PARTIALLY_REFUNDED&#39;, RELEASE: &#39;RELEASED&#39; },&#10;  REFUNDED: {},&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FundState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SPLIT_DONE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PARTIALLY_REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transitions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FundState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FundState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  NONE: { SPLIT: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SPLIT_DONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  SPLIT_DONE: { RELEASE: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, REFUND: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIALLY_REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RELEASED: { REFUND: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIALLY_REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: { REFUND: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIALLY_REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, RELEASE: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  REFUNDED: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 <code>REFUND</code> 在 <code>NONE</code> 状态下到达（即分账还没做），系统把它写入一个 <code>pending_event</code> 表并返回成功——<strong>不报错、不丢弃</strong>。等到 <code>SPLIT</code> 完成后，一个触发器扫出该对象的待处理事件并依次重放。这样：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>调用方永远收到确认，不会无限重投。</li>\n<li>系统内部保证最终按正确顺序执行。</li>\n<li>状态机是显式的，任何非法迁移都能在写代码时枚举出来。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意 <code>PARTIALLY_REFUNDED → RELEASE</code> 这个迁移是合法的，但语义微妙：部分退款后仍然可能释放剩余的货款。释放金额必须按 <code>RESERVED</code> 之外的实际余额计算，见<a href=\"../escrow-available-balance/settlement-release-rule\">确认收货/售后期满释放规则</a>。</p>\n<p>一个必须监控的指标是 <strong><code>pending_event</code> 表的深度与最老记录的年龄</strong>。深度持续增长意味着上游有事件永久缺失（例如渠道回调彻底丢失），这是需要人工介入的信号，不能靠重试自愈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; NONE&#10;    NONE --&gt; SPLIT_DONE: SPLIT&#10;    SPLIT_DONE --&gt; RELEASED: RELEASE&#10;    SPLIT_DONE --&gt; PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: REFUND&#10;    RELEASED --&gt; PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: REFUND&#10;    PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --&gt; RELEASED: RELEASE&#10;    PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --&gt; REFUNDED: REFUND(全额)&#10;    SPLIT_DONE --&gt; REFUNDED: REFUND(全额)&#10;    RELEASED --&gt; REFUNDED: REFUND(全额)&#10;    REFUNDED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; NONE\n    NONE --&gt; SPLIT_DONE: SPLIT\n    SPLIT_DONE --&gt; RELEASED: RELEASE\n    SPLIT_DONE --&gt; PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: REFUND\n    RELEASED --&gt; PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: REFUND\n    PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --&gt; RELEASED: RELEASE\n    PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --&gt; REFUNDED: REFUND(全额)\n    SPLIT_DONE --&gt; REFUNDED: REFUND(全额)\n    RELEASED --&gt; REFUNDED: REFUND(全额)\n    REFUNDED --&gt; [*]</pre><h2 id=\"退款冲分-反向分录-不是删除\">退款冲分：反向分录，不是删除</h2><p>退款发生时，<strong>原分账分录一个字都不能改</strong>。要做的是生成一组方向相反的分录，把原分录的每个分项按比例或按指定分项冲回。</p>\n<p><strong>全额退款</strong>是最简单的情况：把原交易组的每条分录方向取反、金额取原值，<code>reversesEntryId</code> 指向原分录，<code>txGroupId</code> 用一个新组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function buildReversal(originals: LedgerEntry[], refundId: string): LedgerEntry[] {&#10;  return originals.map((e) =&gt; ({&#10;    entryId: ulid(),&#10;    txGroupId: `REV:${refundId}`,&#10;    txSeq: undefined as never,&#10;    accountId: e.accountId,&#10;    direction: e.direction === &#39;DEBIT&#39; ? &#39;CREDIT&#39; : &#39;DEBIT&#39;,&#10;    amountMinor: e.amountMinor,&#10;    currency: e.currency,&#10;    bizType: &#39;REFUND&#39;,&#10;    bizRefId: refundId,&#10;    reversesEntryId: e.entryId,&#10;  })) satisfies LedgerEntry[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildReversal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">originals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">refundId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> originals.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entryId: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ulid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    txGroupId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`REV:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">refundId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    txSeq: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">undefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> never</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accountId: e.accountId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    direction: e.direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEBIT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEBIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amountMinor: e.amountMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currency: e.currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bizType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bizRefId: refundId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reversesEntryId: e.entryId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">satisfies</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>部分退款</strong>才是真正考验设计的地方。退回 50 美元时，这 50 美元应该从哪些分项里出？有三种策略，它们对应完全不同的商业约定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>佣金处理</th>\n<th>运费处理</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按比例冲回</td>\n<td>佣金按退款比例退回商家</td>\n<td>按比例冲回</td>\n<td>默认，最公平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>佣金不退</td>\n<td>退款只冲商品金额，佣金保留</td>\n<td>运费不退</td>\n<td>商家责任退款、低毛利品类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全退</td>\n<td>佣金全额退回</td>\n<td>运费退回</td>\n<td>平台责任、商家申诉成功</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用比例法举例：退款比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>14200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 5000 / 14200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000/14200</span></span></span></span></span>，则佣金冲回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2800</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2800 \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2800</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，商家货款冲回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14200</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14200 \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>取整余数仍然用 largest remainder 处理，且必须保证冲回金额总和不大于原金额</strong>——多冲回就是凭空造钱。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function buildPartialReversal(&#10;  originals: LedgerEntry[],&#10;  refundMinor: number,&#10;  policy: &#39;PROPORTIONAL&#39; | &#39;COMMISSION_RETAINED&#39;,&#10;): LedgerEntry[] {&#10;  const merchantEntries = originals.filter((e) =&gt; e.accountId.startsWith(&#39;MERCHANT&#39;));&#10;  const merchantTotal = merchantEntries.reduce((a, e) =&gt; a + e.amountMinor, 0);&#10;  if (refundMinor &gt; merchantTotal) throw new Error(&#39;refund exceeds merchant share&#39;);&#10;  const allocs = allocate(&#10;    refundMinor,&#10;    merchantEntries.map((e) =&gt; e.amountMinor),&#10;  );&#10;  return merchantEntries.map((e, i) =&gt; ({&#10;    entryId: ulid(),&#10;    txGroupId: `REV:${refundMinor}:${e.bizRefId}`,&#10;    accountId: e.accountId,&#10;    direction: e.direction === &#39;DEBIT&#39; ? &#39;CREDIT&#39; : &#39;DEBIT&#39;,&#10;    amountMinor: allocs[i],&#10;    currency: e.currency,&#10;    bizType: &#39;REFUND&#39;,&#10;    bizRefId: e.bizRefId,&#10;    reversesEntryId: e.entryId,&#10;  })) satisfies LedgerEntry[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildPartialReversal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  originals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  refundMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  policy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PROPORTIONAL'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'COMMISSION_RETAINED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<sp